.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH imify-policies-list 1 "" "imify" ""
.SH NAME
imify\-policies\-list \- List the policies visible to the access token\*(Aqs user
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBimify policies list\fR [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-\-state\fR] [\fB\-\-dataset\fR] [\fB\-q\fR|\fB\-\-quiet\fR] [\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-verbose\fR]... [\fB\-\-yes\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-color\fR] [\fB\-\-api\-url\fR] [\fB\-\-profile\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
List the policies visible to the access token\*(Aqs user
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Write JSON instead of text [env: IMIFY_OUTPUT=json]
.TP
\fB\-\-state\fR \fI<STATE>\fR
Keep policies in this state
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
queued
.IP \(bu 2
training
.IP \(bu 2
ready
.IP \(bu 2
failed
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-dataset\fR \fI<ID>\fR
Keep policies trained on the dataset with this id
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-quiet\fR
Write the result only
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
Log more detail to stderr: \-v for debug, \-vv for trace
.TP
\fB\-\-yes\fR
Confirm without prompting
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-color\fR
Disable color [env: NO_COLOR]
.TP
\fB\-\-api\-url\fR \fI<URL>\fR
API host [env: IMIFY_API_URL] [default: profile, then https://platform.imify.ai]
.TP
\fB\-\-profile\fR \fI<NAME>\fR
Settings profile in the config file [env: IMIFY_PROFILE] [default: default]
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH EXTRA
Examples:
  imify policies list
  imify policies list \-\-state ready \-\-json
  imify policies list \-\-dataset 0b6f3c2e\-8d1a\-4f7e\-9a51\-2c4d6e8f0a13
